# Build output (.app packages) — never delete these; just keep them out of git.
# Folder renamed out/ -> outputAppPackage/ on 2026-09-12: this is now the framework's fixed,
# standard output-folder name (CLAUDE.md -> ALL ALONG -> Packaging & Versioning), not a
# per-project choice.
outputAppPackage/*.app
# also ignore any .app that lands in the repo root (e.g. a VS Code AL: Package run)
/*.app

# Local tooling / editor cruft
.snapshots/
.DS_Store
rad.json
.vscode/rad.json
*.code-search

# Keep .alpackages/ IN the repo: the exact BC v28.4 symbols make the build reproducible.

# Agentic Development Framework — Repository Hygiene (CLAUDE.md, ALL ALONG)
# .bcquality/ moved OUTSIDE this project root entirely (../BootcampClaude.bcquality/) on
# 2026-09-12 — alc recursively compiles every .al file under the project root with no exclusion
# mechanism, and BCQuality's own illustrative .good.al/.bad.al snippets aren't real compilable
# objects. No entry needed here anymore since it isn't inside this repo at all.
# Always gitignored, no per-project choice — this framework's own plumbing, not the deliverable:
scripts/
# OCPF BC AL Patterns library (ALL ALONG -> OCPF BC AL Patterns Library, added 2026-09-13) —
# AJ Ansari's own portable, cross-project pattern collection, fetched from
# github.com/ajansari/ocpfBCALPatterns. Lives inside the project root (unlike .bcquality/,
# nothing in it is .al, so there's no alc compile risk) but is still always gitignored, same
# reasoning as .bcquality/ and scripts/ above — not a per-project choice.
/patterns/
# Gitignored by default (Step 01 §1.8) — AJ Ansari confirmed the default for this project, 2026-09-12:
/CLAUDE.md
/RunbookChangelog.md
/RunbookSchematics.md
/The OCPF BC Agentic Dev Framework Outline.md
